  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now on rearranging we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>We can see it is a linear differential equation,</p><p>So integrating factor is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p>So solution will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now as curve is passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;so&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now calculating the limit&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
